        "notes": "Buy the full Dolomiti Superski, not the Cortina-only pass. The Sellaronda, the Lagazuoi runs and Alta Badia are all on the big one, and the difference across six days is less than a single day ticket. Bought online, so this is a machine and a QR code, not a queue.",
