          "countryCode": "IT",
          "city": "Cortina d'Ampezzo",
          "area": "Tofana"
        },
        "notes": "Ra Valles is 2,500 m and holds cold snow when everything lower is spring mush, so ski it first and low later — most people do exactly the reverse. The top stage to 3,244 m is a viewpoint, not a ski run worth the extra queue on day one.",
